# Documentation map, read by the docs-gate CI job (R13, AC-1-25).
# One rule per line: <glob> -> <doc path>
# A PR that changes a file matching <glob> must also change <doc path>,
# or say why not with a PR-body line "Docs: unchanged – <reason>".
# '**/' matches zero or more folders; '*' and '?' stay inside one folder.
#
# Example:
#   src/api/** -> docs/api.md
